    "title": "Vercel AI SDK 4.0: Streaming Chatbot di Next.js App Router & Tool Calling",
    "description": "Panduan lengkap setup streaming chatbot dengan Vercel AI SDK 4.0 di Next.js App Router, implementasi tool calling multi-step, dan error handling mid-stream.",
